WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:01.084
- I'm gonna win,

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.628
and I'm gonna be smiling the whole time cuz I beat your son.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.172
- That is funny. That's a joke.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:09.259
You beat my son, I will come up and
shake your hand and congratulate you.

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:10.719
That's not gonna happen, Chuck.

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:15.432
- Hey, Google, start a group call.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.186
- Hey, guys, what's up?

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:20.937
Yo, man.

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:21.896
Are you cooking a turkey?

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:23.523
It better not be dry.

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:25.191
- This turkey's gonna be nice.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.609
Never messed one up yet.

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:27.736
- What's going on, Chuck?

00:00:27.902 --> 00:00:30.238
Hey, I don't think any last-minute practice
is gonna help you right now.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.197
- Thanks.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.991
What can I do to get under Steph's skin?

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:34.200
- Right before he's about to putt,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.286
just ask him, "Hey, is my mark OK?"

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:38.121
If it's a little closer, that might get in his head

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.539
and put a little bit of extra pressure on him.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.833
- I'm not sure that'll be an option for you, Chuck.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:45.420
You know, your ball has to be closer to the hole
in order to mark it first.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.796
- Dell, be nice.

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.923
I don't wanna bring up my stats against you.

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:51.760
- This is not the '90s. And I'm
gonna go out on a limb and say

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.261
I'm in a little better shape than you,

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:55.346
so we can take it to the court next time I see you.

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:56.765
- Hey, this is a different game now, Chuck.

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:58.850
We shootin' three-ball; you was all in
the paint.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:01.186
You gotta bring it out and extend that range
these days, my guy.

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:03.354
- I'm not even gonna dignify that with a response.

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:04.773
I'm gonna win—

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.525
and you're gonna have to come and walk up to me and
shake my hand and say congratulations.

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:09.027
- [Laughing] That is funny.

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.528
I've seen both of you play.

00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:11.863
You have no shot.

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:12.822
- Let's make a bet.

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.991
If I hit it on the green on the 19th hole,

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:17.786
you take me to your club for the buffet.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.622
- The 19th hole—isn't that an island green?

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.999
You hit the green, I'll take you to my club.

00:01:22.999 --> 00:01:24.542
I'm buying the buffet dinner.

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:25.460
- Bet.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.419
- The buffet.

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.546
I just saw your eyes light up when you said that.

00:01:28.546 --> 00:01:30.006
- Hey, man, have a good time.

00:01:30.006 --> 00:01:32.300
- Goodbye. And save me some of that dry turkey.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:33.676
- Bye, Chuck.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.599
- If I can get 'em like that, I'll be all right.

